...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

coordinator: FinanceCoordinatorAgent { class: ours }
debt: DebtReductionAgent { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }
runner: Runner { class: ours }
store: InMemorySessionService { class: store }

coordinator -> debt: 3번째 자식 run_async (같은 세션)
debt -> gemini: 모델 호출 (DebtReduction 스키마)
gemini -> debt: JSON 응답
runner -> store: append_event (state_delta: debt_reduction)
